    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96195" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταθμόομαι</span></b> ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταθμάομαι</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>form an
				estimate, judge</i> or <i>conclude by</i> or <i>from</i> a
			thing, freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> in aor. 1, c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				7.11
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				214
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τινὶ ὡς . . , ὅτι . .
			</span>, <i>conclude</i> by a thing that . . , <i><span class="en">
				3.15
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.58
			</span></i> (codd. have <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταθμησάμενοι
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ος</span>) in <i><span class="en">
				2.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.37
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταθμεόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.150
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταθμώμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					7.237
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταθμεύμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.130
				</span></i>
			); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταθμάομαι</span>.</div>
